{
  "title": "Quick Umami Indian Farfalle Pasta",
  "description": "A snappy and indulgent Indian dish featuring farfalle pasta with an Andhra twist, using yuzu-cure for added umami flavor, and is sugar-free-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
